{"3853910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gore Sword ", "steam_appid": 3853910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the most chaotic, unpredictable, bloodiest, and funniest medieval gladiatorial arena ever!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/7a3a87b92a216a3005073a6000cc4e08.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is powered by a real-time physics engine. No preset animations—only real collisions based on force, speed, angle, and mass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/518e4b0f88f3cfe833eae9743662a4d4.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/518e4b0f88f3cfe833eae9743662a4d4.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/518e4b0f88f3cfe833eae9743662a4d4.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/4511c1dff1cba618562f414a8f4d1580.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When weapons are tossed away and armor hits the ground, the most primal and absurd brawls begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/e95d60db39262166ffd5d6798a5c9d88.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/e95d60db39262166ffd5d6798a5c9d88.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/e95d60db39262166ffd5d6798a5c9d88.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/443b6d2ba0835b5545af496bb73ff75c.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The iconic full dismemberment system! With a strong enough strike, arms, legs, and even heads can be severed. Lost an arm? You can still headbutt your enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/d37b9d34b5c3918c691bbb25b1367d85.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/d37b9d34b5c3918c691bbb25b1367d85.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/d37b9d34b5c3918c691bbb25b1367d85.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dbcb4108b5512b46e62949dc7014b2ad.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s a real battle without blunt weapons? Experience the heavy impact of hammers and clubs. While blunt weapons may not sever limbs, they deliver bone-crushing feedback and exaggerated knockbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dddbea269b6c296e80f007867705bc05.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dddbea269b6c296e80f007867705bc05.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dddbea269b6c296e80f007867705bc05.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/bd170b0c3f2f5e02776121cbd3536c77.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit matters! With the real damage system, attacks have a direct impact on the body. Whether it's a slashed limb or a crushed rib, the consequences of each blow are devastatingly realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/51b75ffb7f283af4eacf5b988905351f.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/51b75ffb7f283af4eacf5b988905351f.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/51b75ffb7f283af4eacf5b988905351f.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/45496c0564a2316517df12b45201681b.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join quick matches or create custom rooms to play with friends. The ultimate fun comes from losing control together with your buddies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/df357a1d6a8fa230fc2a70b27bb30354.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/df357a1d6a8fa230fc2a70b27bb30354.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/df357a1d6a8fa230fc2a70b27bb30354.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the most chaotic, unpredictable, bloodiest, and funniest medieval gladiatorial arena ever!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/7a3a87b92a216a3005073a6000cc4e08.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is powered by a real-time physics engine. No preset animations—only real collisions based on force, speed, angle, and mass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/518e4b0f88f3cfe833eae9743662a4d4.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/518e4b0f88f3cfe833eae9743662a4d4.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/518e4b0f88f3cfe833eae9743662a4d4.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v