assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/d37b9d34b5c3918c691bbb25b1367d85.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dbcb4108b5512b46e62949dc7014b2ad.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s a real battle without blunt weapons? Experience the heavy impact of hammers and clubs. While blunt weapons may not sever limbs, they deliver bone-crushing feedback and exaggerated knockbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dddbea269b6c296e80f007867705bc05.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dddbea269b6c296e80f007867705bc05.webm?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/dddbea269b6c296e80f007867705bc05.mp4?t=1773418000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/bd170b0c3f2f5e02776121cbd3536c77.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit matters! With the real damage system, attacks have a direct impact on the body. Whether it's a slashed limb or a crushed rib, the consequences of each blow are devastatingly realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853910/extras/51b75ffb7f283af4eacf5b988905351f.poster.avif?t=1773418000\" width=750 height=422